     "text": "Confidence is a hallmark of the 80-year-old chief executive’s presidential persona, so his willingness to acknowledge he and other top Republicans are “worried” about a number of races is uncharacteristic. But during exchanges with reporters in the Oval Office, and at campaign stops in Texas, Oklahoma and Ohio, he has done just that.",
